    (L : IntermediateField ℚ₃ᵥ ℚ₃ᵥᵃˡᵍ) [FiniteDimensional ℚ₃ᵥ L]
    [IsGalois ℚ₃ᵥ L]
    (M : IntermediateField ℚ₃ᵥ ℚ₃ᵥᵃˡᵍ) [FiniteDimensional ℚ₃ᵥ M]
    (hML : M ≤ L)
