`poitouG` agrees with the smooth models `(1 ± x/6)·q`,
`q = e^{3x/4}/cosh(x/2)`; writing `q' = q·p` with
`p = 3/4 − sinh(x/2)/(2·cosh(x/2))` and `p' = −1/(4·cosh²(x/2))`
